{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-5bab764f40523f6d62de15a84b2e89038f46e08c06e33695","family_id":"KR:012290","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"281677","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=281677","source_sha256":"ff3863dbef2b663e57c1bb50e09c12a98d7d3453e51a869f8e704412139e0470","body_sha256":"62a0c8faf368c5b9d885bd040190377f35d9e462521872a179f9660db1d56883","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 8 (Victim Support Monitoring Division)\n① The head of the Victim Support Monitoring Division shall be appointed as a special-service public official equivalent to Grade IV.\n② The head of the Victim Support Monitoring Division shall be responsible for the following:\n1. Monitoring measures for supporting sufferers and victims;\n2. Fact-finding surveys concerning support for sufferers;\n3. Support for the operation of the Support Subcommittee under Article 16(1) 3 of the Act;\n4. Duties concerning imposition of penalties under Article 51 of the Act in matters within the Division's jurisdiction;\n5. Preparation of the comprehensive report concerning matters within its jurisdiction.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\decree\\en.title.json","sha256":"5fcdc2a396f6cb5050ca3aa8dd7c252bb349913fcd2e730347909ef17576559f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\